<title>USA: Kentek Information 1997 Q1 shr drops to $0.03.</title>
<headline>Kentek Information 1997 Q1 shr drops to $0.03.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>KENTEK INFORMATION SYSTEMS INC.</p>
<p>				   SELECTED FINANCIAL DATA</p>
<p>				     INCOME STATEMENT</p>
<p>Quarter and year-to-date ended</p>
<p>	  September 30	 FY 1997			  FY 1996</p>
<p>     Revenues	     $14,052,000		    $17,736,000</p>
<p>     Income before tax	975,000			2,110,000</p>
<p>     Tax			  768,000			  663,000</p>
<p>     Net Income		 207,000			1,447,000</p>
<p>Proforma Net Income (A)</p>
<p>				   $207,000			 $852,000</p>
<p>Avg.  shares outstanding</p>
<p>				  6,996,000			5,083,000</p>
<p>E.P.S. (fully diluted)</p>
<p>					$0.03			    $0.28</p>
<p>     Proforma-E.P.S.	    $0.03			    $0.17</p>
<p>NOTE: (A) 1996 net income reflects a 40-percent tax rate and the accrual of Excess Liquidation Preference, a cash dividend paid in April 1996 to preferred stockholder</p>
